From ae0b68e9baaf9cfe83842b71362dd681cb3fac98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lzc256 <lzc256@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:58:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add plugin/sync module (fcitx5-sync)

Standalone plugin APK: periodic Rime userdb snapshot sync against a
fcitx5-syncd hub. buildGoCore sets workingDir to the Go core module dir
so its go.mod (x/mobile tool directives) resolves during gomobile bind.
